      "supported": false,
      "issue": "The node infers an upstream/distribution issue solely from the 'transient' nature of the event. Evidence (IA-P01) shows pressure at P-U remained normal while P-R dropped; however, without a point register mapping or flow data confirming no leak downstream, this inference is speculative.",
